SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- HS Mill 72 Bake Shop (23F) C/D Pace-- RSVP required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: (volunteer t
 o lead!)\nRide Sweep: Rick Zook\n\nCoffeeTue rides:\n• A rotating start 
 location\, not a school\n• A predetermined route\n• 25+/- mile routes\
 n• 12 to 14 and 14 to 17 mph average pace\n• “short” stop for refr
 eshment/coffee mid-route at [Mill 72 Bake Shop](https://mill72.com/)\n\nLi
 ke an All Class Ride\, CoffeeTue does not have a single pace.\nAs Sweep\, 
 Rick Zook will bike with any "D" ride cyclist.\nThe CoffeeTue rides are so
 cial rides\, but cyclists are not expected to stay in one group. Cyclists 
 may pedal at their own comfortable paces. A planned stop to regroup is rec
 ommended. Please be supportive of the other cyclists to avoid anyone bikin
 g alone or being dropped off the back of the last group.\n**Be Safe\, Have
  Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nClick for [Ride with GPS](https://routes.lan
 casterbikeclub.net/cue/hs-mill-72-bake-shop-23f/)\n\nHelmets are mandatory
 . No ear buds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tir
 e levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and pa
 per waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join 
 this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. [Join h
 ere](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257
 148).\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Condu
 ct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=2
 57148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clube
 xpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159) \, and
  [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318)\nIn case
  of accident\, consult the [Ride Leader Guide](https://s3.amazonaws.com/Cl
 ubExpressClubFiles/257148/documents/Ride_Leader_Guide_2026_123357428.pdf?A
 WSAccessKeyId=AKIA6MYUE6DNNJ6ROIH3&Expires=1778249903&response-content-dis
 position=inline%3B%20filename%3DRide_Leader_Guide_2026.pdf&Signature=pwxGJ
 6nqlu4w9Zj8Kj%2Fl9U5%2BBtQ%3D).
