SUMMARY:Phil's Hills: Penryn Repeats
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride Leader:** Phil New
 swanger\n\n**Phil’s Hills**: a series of structured hill repeat rides de
 signed to build strength\, endurance and boost your overall fitness.\n\n**
 Route link:** [Phil's Hills: Penryn Repeats](https://ridewithgps.com/route
 s/54544156)\n**PDF link:** [Cuesheet](https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/a
 ssets.modomadethis.com/cuesheets/Phils_Hills_Penryn_Repeats.pdf)\n\nWhat t
 o Expect:\n\n* **Route:** Expect a total distance of approximately **15-20
  miles**\, including **3-4 loops** of a circuit featuring **1-2 climbing s
 egment**.\n* **Focus:** We'll emphasize maintaining a consistent climbing 
 tempo\, active recovery between efforts\, and repeating the effort to buil
 d power and efficiency.\n* **Pace:** We'll maintain a comfortable average 
 pace range of **14-16 mph**.\n* **No-Drop Policy:** You'll never be left b
 ehind! We'll regroup after climbs to ensure everyone stays together.\n\n\\
 -\\-\\-\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds or audible music-playing devi
 ces. Please bring water\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers
 \, pump/CO2 inflator).
